            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abu kamoote kotauka kwape etalakaria akakuan kebino, korina ekatau keteteni eoŋ kacoa, ka epone da loekamunia abaŋaanut, kasodi ajenun nuibusakinito odwe luka ituŋa aswam kokwap kakuj apaarasia kere nuka aijarakec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
