        },
        {
          "text": " Emamei ibore yenitelekarit ajokis korunanan alemar ainyam ka aimat, ka alelakinit aitaaritoike. Abu kaany ŋun da, ebe epote kakan naka Edeke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
